  "details": "Hi!\n\nI think it would be really cool, if the hand tracking with the Selfie Expression would work well in relation to your head.\n\nSo that if you put your hand on your chin, that your avatars hand is also approximately on its chin.\n\nOf course it can't be perfect because of proportions and big/small heads and such, but at the moment the hands are waay further down than they \"should\" be. \n\nWould be cool if you can kind of see and understand if desktop people with Selfie Expression scratch their head or put their hands on the chin to think.\n\nMaybe just putting the hands a little higher up would already do the trick :D",
